file: macros/src/forwarding.rs
breaks: The sentence for a value moved out of a `deref` variant names the way around it, holding a `Box`, as `docs/limits.md` says.
expect: survives
reason: The verdict holds a sentence by its catalogue needle alone, so a sentence whose words outside the needle are wrong still agrees.

find:
which a value cannot be moved out of; hold a `Box`, or {}
replace:
which a value cannot be moved out of; hold an `Rc`, or {}
